---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_BRAND } from '../data/affiliates';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Legal Notice, RUO Terms & FTC Disclosure | ${SITE_BRAND.name}`}
  description="Research Use Only (RUO) terms of use, FTC affiliate disclosure, and privacy policy for PeptideLabIndex.com."
>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-12 space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white">Legal Notice, RUO Terms &amp; Disclosures</h1>

    <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-white">1. Strict Research Use Only (RUO) Scope</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        {SITE_BRAND.domain} is an informational analytical directory indexing publicly available laboratory Certificates of Analysis (HPLC, LC-MS, endotoxin, sterility) for in-vitro laboratory reagents. None of the information, calculators, or supplier reviews on this website constitutes medical advice or clinical guidance. All referenced compounds are strictly NOT for human or veterinary administration.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-white">2. FTC Affiliate &amp; Compensation Disclosure</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        In accordance with FTC 16 CFR Part 255 guidelines, readers are advised that outbound links tagged with <code>rel="sponsored"</code> and partner coupon codes (such as <code>{SITE_BRAND.masterCode}</code>) may generate an affiliate referral commission when a qualifying purchase occurs. Audit scores are computed independently via our 6-axis methodology regardless of affiliate status.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-white">3. Privacy &amp; Zero Tracking Telemetry</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        All calculator inputs (vial mass, bacteriostatic water volume, syringe scale) execute 100% locally in your browser via client-side JavaScript and are never transmitted to any server. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${SITE_BRAND.contactEmail}`} class="text-cyan-400 underline">{SITE_BRAND.contactEmail}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
